data/history/*.csv
!data/history/README.md

# Terminal runtime folders
data/terminal2/*.sqlite
data/terminal2/*.sqlite3
data/terminal2/*.db
data/terminal2/archive_cache/
data/terminal2/extracted_archives/
data/terminal2/exports/
data/terminal2/market_audit/
data/terminal2/market_inputs/
